<title>Game Teka Kata Kerja AI Pro</title>
<style>
body { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; text-align: center; background: #eef2f7; margin: 0; padding: 20px; }
.container { margin-top: 20px; padding: 30px; background: white; display: inline-block; border-radius: 25px; box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); max-width: 450px; width: 95%; }

/* Level & Score Header */
.header-info { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #555; }
.score-box { background: #ffd700; padding: 5px 15px; border-radius: 20px; }

video { width: 100%; border-radius: 20px; border: 4px solid #fff; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); background: #000; }

input { padding: 15px; width: 85%; border: 2px solid #ddd; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 16px; outline: none; transition: 0.3s; }
input:focus { border-color: #4a90e2; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(74,144,226,0.2); }

button { padding: 15px; background: #4a90e2; color: white; border: none; border-radius: 12px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; width: 92%; transition: 0.3s; }
button:hover { background: #357abd; transform: translateY(-2px); }
button:active { transform: translateY(0); }

#result { margin-top: 20px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; min-height: 25px; }

/* Animasi Salah */
.shake { animation: shake 0.5s; }
@keyframes shake {
0% { transform: translateX(0); }
25% { transform: translateX(-10px); }
50% { transform: translateX(10px); }
75% { transform: translateX(-10px); }
100% { transform: translateX(0); }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container" id="game-box">
<div class="header-info">
<div id="level-text">Level: 1/3</div>
<div class="score-box">Markah: <span id="score">0</span></div>
</div>

<h2>Teka Aksi Ini! 🎬</h2>

<video id="game-video" autoplay loop muted playsinline>
<source id="video-source" src="berlari.mp4" type="video/mp4">
</video>

<input type="text" id="user-input" placeholder="Tulis kata kerja di sini..." autocomplete="off">
<button onclick="checkAnswer()">HANTAR JAWAPAN</button>
<p id="result"></p>
</div>

<script>
const gameData = [
{ word: "berlari", vid: "berlari.mp4" },
{ word: "memasak", vid: "memasak.mp4" },
{ word: "melompat", vid: "melompat.mp4" },
{ word: "berenang", vid: "berenang.mp4" }, // Tambah lagi kat sini
{ word: "menari", vid: "menari.mp4" }
];

let currentLevel = 0;
let score = 0;

// Fungsi tekan Enter
document.getElementById('user-input').addEventListener('keypress', function (e) {
if (e.key === 'Enter') {
checkAnswer();
}
});

function checkAnswer() {
const inputField = document.getElementById('user-input');
const resultText = document.getElementById('result');
const videoElement = document.getElementById('game-video');
const videoSource = document.getElementById('video-source');
const gameBox = document.getElementById('game-box');

let answer = inputField.value.toLowerCase().trim();

if (answer === gameData[currentLevel].word) {
// BETUL
score += 10;
document.getElementById('score').innerText = score;
resultText.innerText = "MANTAP! +10 Markah! 🎉";
resultText.style.color = "#28a745";
inputField.style.borderColor = "#28a745";

setTimeout(() => {
currentLevel++;
if (currentLevel < gameData.length) {
// Update Level Text
document.getElementById('level-text').innerText = `Level: ${currentLevel + 1}/${gameData.length}`;
// Tukar video
videoSource.src = gameData[currentLevel].vid;
videoElement.load();
videoElement.play();
// Reset input
inputField.value = "";
inputField.style.borderColor = "#ddd";
resultText.innerText = "";
} else {
// Habis Game
document.querySelector('.container').innerHTML = `
<h2 style="font-size: 40px;">🏆</h2>
<h2>Hebat Gila!</h2>
<p>Kau dah score <b>${score}</b> markah!</p>
<button onclick="location.reload()">MAIN SEMULA</button>
`;
}
}, 1500);

} else {
// SALAH
resultText.innerText = "Aduhai, salah tu! Cuba lagi. 🔥";
resultText.style.color = "#dc3545";
inputField.style.borderColor = "#dc3545";
gameBox.classList.add('shake');
setTimeout(() => { gameBox.classList.remove('shake'); }, 500);
}
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
```

### Apa yang baru?
1. Visual Header: Ada info Level dan Score kat atas. Nampak macam game betul.
2. Auto-focus & Enter: User boleh terus taip dan tekan Enter. Lagi senang nak main berkali-kali.
3. Shake Effect: Kalau salah, satu kotak tu akan bergegar. Ini teknik *UX (User Experience)* yang bagus untuk game.
4. End Screen: Bila dah habis semua level, dia akan keluar skrin kemenangan dengan jumlah markah.

