### 3. Tambah Logic "Auto-Load" (Letak kat atas sekali dalam `<script>`)
Letakkan code ni paling atas sekali di dalam tag `<script>` kau supaya bila web buka, dia terus check ada tak progress lama.

```javascript
window.onload = function() {
const savedName = localStorage.getItem('ai_game_name');
const savedAvatar = localStorage.getItem('ai_game_avatar');
const savedLevel = localStorage.getItem('ai_game_level');
const savedScore = localStorage.getItem('ai_game_score');

if (savedName && savedLevel) {
// Kalau ada data, terus lompat ke Game Page
currentLevel = parseInt(savedLevel);
score = parseInt(savedScore);
chosenAvatar = savedAvatar;

renderProfile(savedName, savedAvatar);
document.getElementById('score').innerText = score;
document.getElementById('level-text').innerText = `LEVEL ${currentLevel + 1}/20`;
document.getElementById('video-source').src = gameData[currentLevel].vid;
document.getElementById('game-video').load();

document.getElementById('startup-page').style.display = 'none';
document.getElementById('game-page').style.display = 'flex';
initClues();
}
};
```

